  descWhiteCalamity: A merciless winter descends without warning. Snow devours the
    roads, frost grips the harvest, and the world slows beneath a shroud of white.
  effectsWhiteCalamity: 'Reduced NPC Spawn Rate

    Cold-Sensitive Ingredients Spoil

    Player
    Movement Decreases'
  imgWhiteCalamity: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7a5aa850e97bc534f9069551ef9b96ab, type: 3}
  descNinthSun: The heavens blaze with relentless fury. Rivers shrink, soil cracks,
    and the air itself burns against the skin. Fever and exhaustion spread through
    the land.
  effectsNinthSun: 'Increased NPC Spawn Rate

    Dragon Heart Price Skyrockets'
  imgNinthSun: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2d4d5680b1e9d484babcd2f791693922, type: 3}
  descWeepingHeavens: Thunder rolls like a royal decree from the skies above. Rain
    falls in unending sheets, swallowing roads and flooding homes.
  effectsWeepingHeavens: 'NPC Flood (Burst Spawns)

    Mandrake Rot'
  imgWeepingHeavens: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0427207b67f964a4f8e9d5f5c7907b32, type: 3}
